Stage 5 – Implement and Demonstrate (3 Marks)
5.1 MySQL Database Setup
First, create the database and table in MySQL Workbench:
CREATE DATABASE campus_events;

USE campus_events;

CREATE TABLE registrations (
    registration_id INT AUTO_INCREMENT PRIMARY KEY,
    student_id VARCHAR(20) NOT NULL,
    student_name VARCHAR(100) NOT NULL,
    department VARCHAR(50) NOT NULL,
    event_name VARCHAR(50) NOT NULL,
    registration_date TIMESTAMP DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,
    UNIQUE (student_id, event_name)
);


The UNIQUE (student_id, event_name) constraint prevents the same student from registering for the same event twice.
